   "seed": 41700101,
   "text": "Save draft \u2192 INSERT procurement_purchase_orders (status='draft', exchange_rate snapshot) + procurement_purchase_order_items.\nA line with an existing item sets inventory_item_id; a free-text line leaves inventory_item_id NULL and keeps item_name only \u2014 the GRN creates the item and back-fills this id (defect D2).\nHeader other_cost is stored ONCE on the PO header; line other_cost is never entered by hand. Allocation happens at receipt, not here (defect D1).\nA draft PO touches NO stock and NO finance rows. Submit for approval \u2192 screen 7.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Save draft \u2192 INSERT procurement_purchase_orders (status='draft', exchange_rate snapshot) + procurement_purchase_order_items.\nA line with an existing item sets inventory_item_id; a free-text line leaves inventory_item_id NULL and keeps item_name only \u2014 the GRN creates the item and back-fills this id (defect D2).\nHeader other_cost is stored ONCE on the PO header; line other_cost is never entered by hand. Allocation happens at receipt, not here (defect D1).\nA draft PO touches NO stock and NO finance rows. Submit for approval \u2192 screen 7.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
