   "text": "Posted receipts are IMMUTABLE \u2014 there is no \u201cEdit posted\u201d. Void writes reversing stock transactions and a reversing payable, both linked to this GRN.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
